<div id="article_show_text">After many months of hard work, we will be releasing RawTherapee 4.0.10 in a few days - it is faster, more stable, has a bunch of new features, and is generally better than any other version, so stay tuned! We have also updated the&nbsp;<a href="blog/documentation" target="_blank" title="Documentation section of the blog">Documentation</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href="blog/screenshots" target="_blank" title="Screenshots section of the blog">Screenshots</a>&nbsp;pages, with further updates coming to the other sections soon.</div>

